    "directions": [
      "The purpose of the citrus is to fill the turkey cavity. A mix of citrus is best, but use whatever you have on hand! You just need enough to fill the turkey.",
      "The container should be large enough to hold the turkey and fit inside the fridge. I found the fridge vegetable drawer (the one on the bottom) works perfectly in this case.",
      "USDA recommended safe temperature.",
      "The small window on the top will let steam out and keep the turkey skin crispy."
